@title A placed circuit lands in the visible part of a drawn page
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Test report 16: circuits dropped at a fixed top-left spot, off screen once the page had a drawing and the view was panned.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text fuse
key Return
click 900 500
wait 5
key Escape
scroll 500 300 -150
wait 10
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
try click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button
wait 20
shot placed
expect "Placed Motor starter DOL"
